pluk: [x::]: compute is empty
pluk: [x::,]: operator missing after ','
pluk: [x::^a:]: column name missing after ':'
pluk: [x::^a,nosuch]: unknown operator [nosuch]
pluk: [p/x//s::^1]: mixed '/' and '//' in NAME: P/SPEC/S, or P//SPEC//S to keep the original (pick's P/SPEC//S)
pluk: [x::+(a]: [+(a]: regex parse error:
    (a
    ^
error: unclosed group
pluk: [x::^1,addall,nosuch]: unknown operator [nosuch]
pluk: [+(::^1]: [+(]: regex parse error:
    (
    ^
error: unclosed group
